      "statement": "validate_picks() enforces that a Planner selection uses only habits in the reviewed shortlists, does not duplicate IDs, does not pick unknown levels or needs_cue habits, stays within max_active habits and available_minutes including carried habits, and does not drop a goal the reviewed template covered.",
